description	"The Arc Trooper - Heavy Weapons Specialist

Based on open mode's Arc Trooper class, the alternative variant invests into the grenade launcher of the Arc trooper rifle plus a rocket launcher. Like other classes in super open mode its health and armor have been significantly increased. 

^2Weaponry:
- Clone Pistol (1)
- PLX-1 Rocket Launcher (6 Rockets)
- Westar M5 w/ Grenade Launcher (1)
- 5 Pulse Grenades
- 3 Trip Mines

^8Attributes:
- Stamina (3)
- Dexterity (2)
- Blast Armour
- CTF: 32s Respawn

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]

^2Strengths^7: Very Thick Armor, strong armament and devestating to SBDs and Droidekas.
^1Weaknesses^7: Less agile then other 1 life classes."